quotation."]}]]}],["$","details","2",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm open:border-[#C8A97E]/40","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm sm:text-base [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["Is kitchen fitting labour cheaper if I buy the kitchen myself?",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[#C8A97E] text-xl leading-none group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform flex-shrink-0","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-5 text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-gray-50 pt-4","children":["It can be, but only if the design, quantities and components are correct. You may also need to arrange delivery, deal with missing parts and pay for return visits if the kitchen is not ready to install."]}]]}],["$","details","3",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm open:border-[#C8A97E]/40","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm sm:text-base [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden","children":["How long does it take to fit a kitchen?",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-[#C8A97E] text-xl leading-none group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform flex-shrink-0","children":"+"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"px-5 pb-5 text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-gray-50 pt-4","children":["A straightforward kitchen may take several working days. A full renovation involving rewiring, plumbing changes, flooring, tiling or structural alterations can take substantially longer."]}]]}],["$","details","4",{"className":"group bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm open:border-[#C8A97E]/40","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm sm:text-base